        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this lovely three-bedroom, one-bathroom end of terrace family home with a self-contained unit to the rear and large garage to the side to the market, ideally located on Seskin View Road, Oldbawn, Dublin 24. \r\n\r\nSituated in the popular Old Bawn area, this property enjoys an enviable location. Old Bawn Shopping Centre, and The Square Shopping Centre, are just a short drive away, offering a vibrant mix of retail, dining, and entertainment options. Families will appreciate the proximity to several well-regarded schools, while nature lovers will delight in the nearby Dodder Valley Park, perfect for leisurely walks or outdoor activities. \r\n\r\nCommuting is effortless with excellent transport links. Dublin Bus routes, including the 49, 65b S8 and S6, provide convenient and reliable access to the city centre and surrounding areas. The M50 motorway, just minutes away, offers quick connections to Dublin Airport, the greater Dublin area, and beyond. Whether you're traveling for work, school, or leisure, this location ensures that everything you need is within easy reach.\r\n\r\nBright, airy and most spacious internal living accommodation of c. 91 sqm compromises of entrance hallway, large living room with fireplace, fully fitted kitchen and extra-large garage to the side, On the first floor you have three spacious bedrooms and main family bathroom which comes fully tiled. \r\n\r\nTo the rear of the property you have a private & enclosed garden with a self-contained unit that can be used for so many different purposes. The front provides ample off-street parking on a low maintenance driveway with a large green area on the side.\r\n\r\nNumber 31 Seskin View Road comes to the market in good condition throughout & in need of some modernisation but due to its size & location has the potential to be the perfect family home, it has plenty of additional features such as spacious living, double glazed windows, unit to the rear and large garage to name but a few. \r\n\r\nContact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today to arrange a viewing and see all that this home has to offer! \r\n\r\nAdditional Features; \r\nBER F \r\nC. 91 sqm \r\n3 Bed / 1 Bath\r\nLarge garage to the side \r\nPresented in good condition \r\nSelf-contained unit to the rear \r\nCan be used for so many different purposes\r\nEnd of terrace family home \r\nJust some cosmetic modernisation needed \r\nExtremely spacious home \r\nEntrance hallway with ample storage\r\nLarge living room with fireplace \r\nFully fitted kitchen \r\nLarge open plan kitchen/dining area\r\nThree double bedrooms\r\nMain family bathroom fully tiled \r\nOil fired central heating\r\nDouble glazed windows\r\nTop quality blinds \r\nPlenty of parking to the front \r\nMaintenance free driveway \r\nLocated beside large green area \r\nPlenty of bus routes on your doorstep \r\nWithin arm's reach of M50 and N7 Motorway \r\nHighly sought-after area \r\nPrime for first time buyers \r\n\r\nDirections: D24 EAE9"
      },
